msgstr "You added it by hand from GitHub: Unricopie installs what its repository publishes, but it hasn't reviewed it and doesn't know what it needs."

msgid "Es el único proyecto del catálogo que lleva este juego a PC."
msgstr "It's the only project in the catalog that brings this game to PC."

